== ieee_16_7_leading_delay2
# evidence: derived
# §16.7 list of ##N a forms: ##2 a means `true ##1 `true ##1 a, so a is checked two ticks after the start.
# Attempt at 0 sees a at 2 and passes at 2. Attempt at 4 sees a at 5 only, one tick early, and fails at 6 (derived).
property: go |-> ##2 a
signals: go a
clause: 16.7 16.12.7
class: normative
origin: IEEE 1800-2017 §16.7 ##2 a example, re-expressed
sample  : 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7
go      : 1 . . . 1 . . .
a       : . . 1 . . 1 . .
fail    : . . . . . . 1 .
pass    : . . 1 . . . . .
pending: 0

