== ieee_16_9_2_repetition_range_1_to_5_second_iteration
# evidence: derived
# §16.9.2 (a ##2 b)[*1:5] is the or of one to five iterations. Followed by ##1 c: iteration 1 ends at 2 but c is low at 3; iteration 2
# (a at 3, b at 5) ends at 5 and c at 6 completes the match. The failed first alternative does not fail the attempt; passes at 6 (derived).
property: go |-> (a ##2 b)[*1:5] ##1 c
signals: go a b c
clause: 16.9.2 16.9.7 16.12.7
class: normative
origin: IEEE 1800-2017 §16.9.2 (a ##2 b)[*1:5] example, re-expressed
