== ieee_16_9_3_en_and_rose_req_then_gnt
# evidence: derived
# §16.9.3 assertion a1: whenever en is high and req rises, gnt must be asserted at the next cycle. req rises at 2 (en high): gnt at 3,
# pass at 3. req rises at 5 with en low: vacuous. req rises at 8 (en high): gnt low at 9, fail at 9.
property: en && $rose(req) |=> gnt
signals: req en gnt
clause: 16.9.3 16.12.7
class: normative
