== ieee_16_9_9_fig16_12_throughout_fails_when_burst_mode_rises
# evidence: figure
# Inputs as drawn: burst_mode high at tick 1, low at 2 to 8, high from 9; irdy high at 1, 2, low at 3 to 11, high from 12; trdy high at 1 to 3,
# low at 4 to 10, high from 11 (each edge of the drawing lies between two ticks, so the sampled value changes at the next tick).
# §16.9.9 Figure 16-12 (ticks from 1; sample = tick - 1): the attempt starts at tick 2 (go there; $fell(burst_mode) holds). The subsequence
# (trdy==0 && irdy==0) is true for ticks 4 to 10, but burst_mode rises at tick 9, so throughout fails: failure at tick 9 (sample 8).
